# Allowlist: the build context is only what the Dockerfile copies. Everything else
# (.git, .venv, models, databases, .env with tokens, viewer/node_modules) stays out.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!README.md
!src/
!configs/
# CI only: tests/launcher/Dockerfile.e2e adds these; the published image never copies them.
!tests/launcher/e2e/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
